 health &amp; longevity</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Reclaim optimal wellbeing at Hippocrates Wellness, the original pioneers of health and longevity for 70 years. Our personalized Wellness Programs and flexible Hippocrates Passports utilize cutting-edge technology alongside a progressive approach to help you achieve your health and fitness goals.</p><p>Design your perfect wellbeing journey, tailored to suit your schedule and needs. Our world-leading experts, with decades of experience in nutrition, integrative health, and holistic and Western medicine, offer ground-breaking lectures, one-to-one consultations, and organic, enzyme-rich, plant-based cuisine. Experience life-changing therapies, advanced treatments, state-of-the-art facilities, and more in a stunning, eco-conscious, tranquil setting.</p><p>Whether you're looking for a short visit or a longer, more immersive stay, our structured Programs and flexible Passports allow you to escape everyday stress and distractions to reset your mind, body, and spirit. Discover your ideal experience at Hippocrates Wellness today. We can't wait to meet you and help you transform your life!</p><p><a href=\"https://cal.services/Marketing1/Consultation-with-a-Hippocrates-Wellness-Consultant/p2uhe5iJI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-anchor=\"#\">SPEAK TO A WELLNESS CONSULTANT &gt;</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Discover the perfect health journey for you</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t21 Days\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Whether you want to reverse or prevent serious health conditions or reset, reboot, and rebalance your body, mind, and spirit, the globally renowned Hippocrates Wellness Life Transformation Program is the ultimate experience for transforming your mental and physical wellbeing at any stage of life.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/programs/resort-programs/life-transformation-program\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearn More\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t28 Days\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Our Comprehensive Cancer Wellness Program is based on a holistic approach to help you restore your metabolic health, up-regulate your immune system, and mobilize your vitality to accelerate healing and wellness. Hippocrates Wellness has a renowned international reputation for helping people from all over the world with cancer to restore their health.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/health-challenges/comprehensive-cancer-wellness-program/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLearn More\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Reclaim optimal health &amp; longevity</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Book your free consultation today</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBook A Free Consultation\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Learn how you can rejuvenate and reset your life with Hippocrates Wellness</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/4a5a08c8-4edabd0f.mp4\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Hear from Hippocrates alumni &amp; their life-changing journeys</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>\n.video_slider .slick-slide {\n  transition: transform .3s ease;\n}\n.video_slider .slick-current.slick-center {\n  top: 50%;\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n  transform-origin: center center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 9;\n}\n.video_slider .slick-current.slick-center .elementor-element-populated {\n  box-shadow:0px 10px 30px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n}\n.video_slider .slick-slider .slick-arrow {\n    padding: 0;\n    background: unset;\n    font-size:0;\n}\n.video_slider .slick-prev:before,.video_slider .slick-next:before {\n    color: #000;\n    font-size:40px;\n}\n.video_slider button.slick-prev.slick-arrow {\n    left: -60px;\n}\n.video_slider button.slick-next.slick-arrow {\n    right: -40px;\n}\n.slick-dots \n { position: absolute; bottom: -45px; \nlist-style